OL,5,G2130 Music Planet
OL,6,     FKathryn Tickell looks back on a
OL,7,     Fsummer well spent, picking out
OL,8,     Fhighlights from folk and
OL,9,     Froots-based artists she
OL,10,     Fencountered on festival stages at
OL,11,     Fhome and abroad.
OL,12,G2230 New Music Show
OL,13,     FTom Service with a new work by
OL,14,     FCassie Kinoshi, performed by the
OL,15,     FManchester Collective at Leeds'
OL,16,     FHoward Assembly Room in June. Plus
OL,17,     Fhighlights from the Young Composer
OL,18,     FProm.
